WEBVTT

01:41.410 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.670 --> 01:48.910
[Episode 18]

01:51.789 --> 01:53.039
I made this myself.

01:54.789 --> 01:55.400
It's for you.

01:58.150 --> 01:59.509
You used to be into such stuff.

02:01.840 --> 02:02.790
"Used to"?

02:03.680 --> 02:04.840
Master, you...

02:26.840 --> 02:28.560
Master, you drunk?

02:31.280 --> 02:32.520
Master, who do you

02:33.280 --> 02:34.680
take me for?

02:35.280 --> 02:36.079
Who?

02:38.120 --> 02:39.430
You're the one I've been thinking about

02:39.430 --> 02:40.630
for these 19 years, of course.

02:50.910 --> 02:51.430
What about you?

02:53.370 --> 02:54.620
What am I to you?

02:57.920 --> 02:58.810
I used to think

02:58.840 --> 03:00.630
you had at least some feelings for me.

03:02.560 --> 03:03.680
But after stirring up emotions

03:03.680 --> 03:04.800
I couldn't bear to let go of,

03:05.520 --> 03:06.890
you still chose Su Yu.

03:08.000 --> 03:09.240
Master, you're drunk.

03:09.550 --> 03:10.560
I'm not...

03:13.630 --> 03:14.520
Then tell me.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.310
Everyone says

03:16.310 --> 03:17.710
Mu Qingge was so obsessed with me.

03:18.590 --> 03:19.560
Was that true?

03:25.960 --> 03:27.240
Someone smiled at you,

03:27.960 --> 03:28.680
treated you well,

03:29.680 --> 03:31.079
and called you the best,

03:31.740 --> 03:33.460
making you think this was an obsession.

03:34.910 --> 03:36.240
But it was all bullshit.

03:40.100 --> 03:44.960
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

03:41.470 --> 03:42.870
If I were given another chance,

03:45.520 --> 03:46.870
I would still fall deeply in love.

03:46.970 --> 03:52.710
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

03:50.750 --> 03:51.470
I just

03:51.870 --> 03:52.680
couldn't avoid it.

03:53.540 --> 03:56.750
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

03:56.960 --> 03:58.190
I've long known I shouldn't,

03:57.270 --> 03:59.590
♫Solitary branches hidden in clothing♫

03:58.520 --> 03:59.240
and I don't deserve it.

04:00.410 --> 04:06.590
♫Extend fate to call you back; How lucky to meet by chance♫

04:01.870 --> 04:03.680
But even if it's just a fleeting moment of affection,

04:04.240 --> 04:05.310
I still want to indulge in it.

04:07.430 --> 04:12.590
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

04:08.680 --> 04:10.450
But God loves playing tricks on me.

04:14.310 --> 04:19.690
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

04:16.630 --> 04:18.630
The person I love is right in front of me,

04:20.750 --> 04:22.120
but I can't court her.

04:20.990 --> 04:23.840
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

04:24.320 --> 04:27.340
♫Demon or immortal?♫

04:24.920 --> 04:25.800
Neither can I let her go.

04:27.880 --> 04:34.210
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

04:29.750 --> 04:30.360
Can we only end up

04:30.360 --> 04:31.630
like this in this life?

04:34.680 --> 04:38.090
♫If love wants me to die♫

04:38.420 --> 04:41.340
♫I won't give up because of you♫

04:41.720 --> 04:43.409
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

04:43.470 --> 04:47.230
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

04:46.560 --> 04:47.800
Master, open your eyes!

04:47.250 --> 04:51.540
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

04:48.480 --> 04:50.120
See who you are kissing!

04:50.520 --> 04:51.390
Of course it's you.

04:52.080 --> 04:55.340
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

04:55.520 --> 05:01.590
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

05:02.020 --> 05:05.520
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

05:05.840 --> 05:09.090
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

05:09.200 --> 05:15.590
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

05:09.390 --> 05:10.720
What on earth am I doing?

05:16.070 --> 05:19.450
♫If love wants me to die♫

05:18.920 --> 05:19.560
If you'll still

05:19.560 --> 05:21.040
end up getting hurt because of me,

05:19.730 --> 05:22.690
♫I won't give up because of you♫

05:22.390 --> 05:23.750
I might as well end it here

05:22.910 --> 05:24.870
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

05:24.990 --> 05:29.410
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

05:25.360 --> 05:26.920
and let you leave me.

05:29.650 --> 05:33.270
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

05:33.520 --> 05:36.810
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

05:35.240 --> 05:36.720
Master, you truly consider

05:36.720 --> 05:38.190
everything for Master Mu.

05:37.260 --> 05:43.159
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

05:38.630 --> 05:40.870
Like the most devoted lover in the world.

05:43.590 --> 05:53.680
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

05:48.560 --> 05:49.360
Xue Ranran,

05:51.560 --> 05:53.040
you're such a fool.

05:56.870 --> 05:58.120
Ranran, how are you feeling now?

05:59.400 --> 06:00.310
It's not even raining.

06:01.270 --> 06:03.000
But why do you smell so bitter and astringent?

06:05.630 --> 06:06.810
I shouldn't have

06:07.380 --> 06:08.380
fallen for Master.

06:10.070 --> 06:11.580
I really did get punishment.

06:17.950 --> 06:18.480
Sovereign.

06:20.950 --> 06:22.120
The medicine for Tu Jiuyuan?

06:22.730 --> 06:23.290
Yes.

06:30.680 --> 06:31.560
Where are those premium herbs

06:31.630 --> 06:32.750
from the pill and medicine storehouse?

06:33.520 --> 06:34.800
Send them all to her.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.310
I've already lost Da Wu.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.800
I can't afford to lose Tu Jiuyuan as well.

06:41.159 --> 06:41.870
Do you understand?

06:42.830 --> 06:43.360
Yes, My Lord.

07:12.560 --> 07:13.360
My Lord,

07:13.840 --> 07:15.070
this is all

07:15.090 --> 07:16.370
the Illusion Liquid we refined this time.

07:22.430 --> 07:24.040
It couldn't even nail that small task.

07:24.800 --> 07:26.270
I don't need this useless thing.

07:27.160 --> 07:27.750
Get lost.

07:28.090 --> 07:28.650
Yes, My Lord.

07:36.270 --> 07:36.750
Come here

07:37.200 --> 07:38.530
and drink with me.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.159
Ziyun,

07:57.630 --> 07:58.240
Elder,

07:58.800 --> 07:59.920
why are you up?

08:01.600 --> 08:03.120
Why is it so noisy outside?

08:03.850 --> 08:04.850
The Lord

08:05.310 --> 08:06.750
is having fun with those dancing girls

08:06.750 --> 08:07.680
and courtesan again.

08:11.100 --> 08:12.100
My Lord.

08:12.480 --> 08:13.600
Good wine.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.600
My Lord.

08:14.640 --> 08:16.070
Come on.

08:21.000 --> 08:21.920
My Lord,

08:21.960 --> 08:23.450
take another sip.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.190
My Lord,

08:26.190 --> 08:27.530
how can you indulge in lust

08:27.560 --> 08:28.510
in the main hall?

08:29.210 --> 08:29.860
Get out...

08:30.720 --> 08:31.760
All of you, get out!

08:36.390 --> 08:37.309
Where are you going?

08:40.669 --> 08:41.440
My Lord!

09:09.360 --> 09:10.120
My Lord...

09:12.330 --> 09:12.880
Come here.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.150
So charming.

09:37.670 --> 09:39.360
I like it.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.480
My Lord,

09:55.840 --> 09:56.640
you're drunk.

09:58.670 --> 09:59.580
Where are you going?

10:01.120 --> 10:01.840
Could it be that

10:03.810 --> 10:05.690
you're playing hard to get with me?

10:10.830 --> 10:12.080
M-My Lord.

10:41.240 --> 10:41.620
You...

10:41.960 --> 10:42.720
Why are you here?

10:44.870 --> 10:45.630
Last night,

10:46.910 --> 10:47.720
you were intoxicated.

10:51.050 --> 10:52.490
Even if I was drunk, I wouldn't have...

10:58.720 --> 10:59.390
My Lord,

10:59.990 --> 11:01.200
this is all

11:01.220 --> 11:03.040
the Illusion Liquid we refined this time.

11:10.870 --> 11:11.870
Even if I was drunk,

11:12.280 --> 11:13.240
what about you?

11:13.710 --> 11:14.120
You...

11:15.270 --> 11:16.790
You tried to mess up with me on purpose?

11:17.600 --> 11:18.890
So I played some tricks,

11:19.440 --> 11:20.670
threw myself at you,

11:21.000 --> 11:22.360
and displeased you, My Lord?

11:23.030 --> 11:23.480
Shut up.

11:23.910 --> 11:24.360
That's enough.

11:34.390 --> 11:35.670
Let's pretend this never happened.

11:36.180 --> 11:37.120
And do not mention this

11:37.120 --> 11:37.840
to anyone.

11:38.370 --> 11:38.810
Otherwise...

11:38.840 --> 11:39.370
My Lord!

11:43.570 --> 11:44.440
My Lord,

11:44.910 --> 11:45.440
the pill storehouse...

11:49.020 --> 11:49.830
Elder Tu?

11:50.770 --> 11:51.550
What are you looking at?

11:52.390 --> 11:53.860
If you dare to spill a word of this,

11:54.240 --> 11:55.490
I'll cut off your tongue.

11:55.510 --> 11:56.080
Yes, My Lord.

11:56.960 --> 11:57.480
So what's the matter?

11:58.040 --> 11:58.430
Speak.

11:59.100 --> 11:59.880
As you ordered,

12:00.000 --> 12:01.200
we've sent the Scarlet-Dew Ganoderma Pills

12:01.630 --> 12:02.870
from the pill storehouse to...

12:03.200 --> 12:03.600
Enough.

12:03.830 --> 12:04.590
I got it.

12:05.320 --> 12:05.670
Yes.

12:05.880 --> 12:06.670
I'll take my leave, My Lord.

12:16.070 --> 12:17.000
What are you waiting for?

12:17.200 --> 12:17.750
Get out of here quickly.

12:18.320 --> 12:19.230
Don't let anyone else see this.

12:38.510 --> 12:40.480
How did this happen?

12:42.390 --> 12:43.320
After this...

12:52.360 --> 12:52.750
You.

12:55.450 --> 12:56.690
I didn't see anything, My Lord.

12:56.710 --> 12:57.720
I saw nothing.

12:57.740 --> 12:59.070
M-My Lord, please spare my life!

13:00.390 --> 13:01.440
When did I say

13:01.460 --> 13:02.420
I'd end your life?

13:05.080 --> 13:05.510
Get up.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.360
Tell me.

13:10.000 --> 13:11.480
If you were drunk

13:12.630 --> 13:13.630
and did something

13:14.200 --> 13:15.510
inappropriate to someone,

13:16.440 --> 13:17.440
how would you deal with her?

13:18.600 --> 13:19.080
Kill her.

13:20.030 --> 13:20.670
Not this!

13:26.790 --> 13:28.030
Then just

13:28.410 --> 13:29.320
marry her.

13:33.690 --> 13:37.020
I didn't mean to do this either...

13:37.840 --> 13:38.320
My Lord,

13:38.900 --> 13:40.490
to be honest...

13:41.320 --> 13:41.870
Well,

13:43.360 --> 13:44.360
our Scarlet Sect

13:44.930 --> 13:47.290
will need a mistress sooner or later

13:47.510 --> 13:48.750
to help you manage affairs.

13:50.260 --> 13:50.910
Elder Tu,

13:51.400 --> 13:53.200
she's been dedicated to the sect all these years.

13:53.450 --> 13:55.120
And she grew up with you

13:55.150 --> 13:56.240
at the Scarlet Sect together.

13:57.150 --> 13:58.270
Isn't she just perfectly suitable for that role?

13:59.200 --> 13:59.790
Suitable?

14:00.910 --> 14:01.830
She's completely stiff

14:01.860 --> 14:03.320
from head to toe,

14:03.340 --> 14:04.410
never willing to give in.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.240
How is she suitable?

14:12.000 --> 14:12.520
Hold on.

14:15.150 --> 14:17.150
I was caught up in that Illusion Spell,

14:17.430 --> 14:18.170
but she wasn't.

14:20.150 --> 14:21.480
Yet she didn't push me away.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.670
Doesn't that mean I won?

14:24.080 --> 14:24.960
That's right!

14:26.730 --> 14:27.750
I won.

14:28.750 --> 14:29.720
If that's the case,

14:29.890 --> 14:31.710
what's wrong with giving her a title?

14:31.960 --> 14:32.750
Exactly!

14:33.570 --> 14:34.270
Elder Tu.

14:37.200 --> 14:37.800
My Lord.

14:40.910 --> 14:41.390
You may leave now.

14:41.870 --> 14:42.200
Yes, My Lord.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.270
You came at the right time.

14:49.150 --> 14:50.320
I've just decided,

14:51.030 --> 14:52.510
since you've been so dedicated

14:52.560 --> 14:54.480
to Scarlet Sect all these years,

14:55.550 --> 14:56.510
I'll let you

14:57.320 --> 14:58.050
sit by my right side

14:58.080 --> 14:59.240
from now on,

15:00.000 --> 15:00.910
and stay close to me.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.630
That won't be necessary.

15:03.720 --> 15:05.390
My Lord, I'm here to tell you

15:06.320 --> 15:08.000
that I happened to be in a bad mood yesterday as well,

15:08.350 --> 15:09.320
so I used it as a way to relieve.

15:09.810 --> 15:11.210
We should treat it as a night of fun,

15:11.960 --> 15:12.670
nothing else.

15:14.670 --> 15:15.720
Is that really what you think?

15:16.360 --> 15:17.240
What else should it be?

15:20.870 --> 15:21.910
You said that.

15:22.750 --> 15:23.320
I already

15:23.440 --> 15:24.680
gave you the chance.

15:25.020 --> 15:26.740
Don't come bothering me in the future.

15:29.390 --> 15:30.440
Rest assured, My Lord.

15:41.920 --> 15:43.210
That actually saved me a lot of trouble.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.670
A night of fun?

15:52.630 --> 15:54.400
You treat me as some cheap thrills?

15:56.240 --> 15:57.270
You've got some nerve, Tu Jiuyuan!

15:57.520 --> 15:58.090
My Lord.

15:59.270 --> 15:59.670
My Lord.

15:59.830 --> 16:01.320
My Lord, Mu Qingge requests an audience outside the hall.

16:03.330 --> 16:04.920
Greetings, My Lord.

16:06.790 --> 16:08.080
What brings the great beauty Mu

16:08.220 --> 16:10.820
here with such leisure?

16:12.120 --> 16:12.960
Leisure?

16:14.000 --> 16:15.120
It took me a lot of effort to find an opportunity

16:15.150 --> 16:16.480
to counter Su Yishui,

16:17.100 --> 16:18.150
yet the mission was failed.

16:19.130 --> 16:20.920
I was so angry that I was sleepless through the night.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.150
How could I be as untroubled

16:23.180 --> 16:24.340
as the great sovereign Wei?

16:25.120 --> 16:25.720
Mistakes,

16:26.120 --> 16:26.790
blame...

16:27.250 --> 16:28.500
all brushed aside by you.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.200
What are you implying

16:42.080 --> 16:43.670
by saying that?

16:44.030 --> 16:45.600
That useless Tu Jiuyuan

16:45.980 --> 16:46.860
ruined everything,

16:47.180 --> 16:49.120
yet she didn't even realize
she should fight to the death to make up for it.

16:49.670 --> 16:50.870
What's the point of keeping her alive?

16:51.120 --> 16:52.200
Why haven't you killed her yet?

16:53.360 --> 16:54.360
My affairs

16:54.420 --> 16:55.900
are none of your concern.

16:56.430 --> 16:58.220
Tu Jiuyuan is my subordinate.

16:58.550 --> 16:59.960
If I want her dead,

17:00.320 --> 17:01.170
she dies.

17:02.200 --> 17:04.310
If I'm happy to let her live, she lives.

17:04.960 --> 17:06.680
You have no right to question this!

17:07.560 --> 17:09.210
I may call her useless,

17:09.480 --> 17:10.550
but you dare not.

17:11.270 --> 17:12.480
Is that clear?

17:14.440 --> 17:15.920
I didn't expect the great sovereign Wei

17:16.720 --> 17:17.589
to be so protective of her.

17:19.960 --> 17:20.589
It's none of your business.

17:22.920 --> 17:23.710
Now, tell me.

17:24.550 --> 17:26.240
What brings you

17:28.000 --> 17:29.310
to me today?

17:32.000 --> 17:33.640
Of course, I'm here for the whereabouts of Su Yishui

17:34.160 --> 17:35.270
and that

17:35.270 --> 17:36.160
other piece of fruit.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.770
Another piece of fruit?

17:39.920 --> 17:41.030
Have you found her?

17:41.790 --> 17:42.610
Is it Su Yishui's

17:42.640 --> 17:43.720
little disciple?

17:44.400 --> 17:45.110
That's right.

17:46.030 --> 17:47.640
That day at the foot of Mount Cuiwei,

17:48.000 --> 17:49.410
when that girl's spiritual power surged,

17:49.830 --> 17:51.400
I sensed it clearly from the shadows

17:51.420 --> 17:52.870
that my own spiritual power was also affected.

17:53.750 --> 17:54.550
It must be her.

17:55.000 --> 17:55.960
I'm sure of it.

17:58.790 --> 18:00.160
So it's true.

18:01.790 --> 18:03.510
Well, well, Su Yishui,

18:04.590 --> 18:05.760
you've fooled me

18:05.790 --> 18:06.750
time and time again.

18:07.310 --> 18:09.160
I certainly won't let you off the hook.

18:13.810 --> 18:14.880
I have a plan.

18:17.880 --> 18:18.350
Wait.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.240
It's a bit strange.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.350
Why would Su Yishui

18:25.350 --> 18:26.480
keep that useless sister of yours

18:26.480 --> 18:27.310
by his side?

18:27.830 --> 18:28.740
What's he trying to do?

18:30.550 --> 18:31.590
Who cares what he's doing?

18:32.350 --> 18:33.830
As long as we kill those two,
both the master and disciple,

18:34.510 --> 18:35.850
you can take revenge on Su Yishui

18:35.880 --> 18:37.790
for repeatedly humiliating you.

18:38.720 --> 18:40.200
And my memories and spiritual power

18:40.680 --> 18:41.680
will all come back as well.

18:42.530 --> 18:43.310
The Spirit Spring...

18:44.030 --> 18:45.110
will be yours too.

18:51.030 --> 18:52.110
You used to be...

18:53.130 --> 18:54.930
so generous.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.160
Why are you

18:58.790 --> 19:00.550
more impatient than I am

19:00.830 --> 19:01.790
to see them dead now?

19:02.880 --> 19:04.550
In my past life, what did my generosity

19:05.550 --> 19:07.070
eventually bring me in the end?

19:08.620 --> 19:10.210
Anyone who has wronged me in the past,

19:11.200 --> 19:13.030
I'll make them pay one by one.

19:17.960 --> 19:19.640
You've become just as bad as me now.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.880
How boring.

19:26.580 --> 19:27.230
Well then, tell me,

19:28.350 --> 19:29.240
what's your scheme?

19:37.720 --> 19:38.440
Mr. Zeng.

19:40.240 --> 19:40.880
Your wounds

19:40.920 --> 19:41.410
have nearly healed

19:41.440 --> 19:42.350
over the past few days.

19:43.310 --> 19:44.720
After finishing breakfast and packing up,

19:45.010 --> 19:45.790
you may go down the mountain

19:45.810 --> 19:46.720
with your master.

19:48.960 --> 19:49.590
Bai Baishan.

19:51.030 --> 19:51.970
You'll come back with me

19:52.000 --> 19:52.640
to continue your cultivation.

19:53.130 --> 19:53.640
Yes, Master.

19:54.300 --> 19:55.030
Understood.

19:56.830 --> 19:57.650
I wonder how

19:57.680 --> 19:58.160
they've been living here?

19:58.350 --> 19:59.110
Have they been sleeping well?

20:01.110 --> 20:01.640
You came at the right time.

20:02.310 --> 20:02.920
We were just about to

20:02.920 --> 20:04.070
bid farewell to you two seniors.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.440
Thank you for your hospitality these past few days.

20:06.790 --> 20:07.510
Seniors,

20:07.790 --> 20:09.030
thank you for looking after us these past few days.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.400
When I have more time,

20:10.550 --> 20:11.680
I'll come back to brew some wine for you.

20:11.880 --> 20:12.200
Good.

20:13.350 --> 20:13.720
Ranran,

20:14.550 --> 20:15.770
I feel like we've known each other for years.

20:15.870 --> 20:16.680
I'm very fond of you.

20:17.030 --> 20:18.400
I'll give you these small magical tools as gifts.

20:18.640 --> 20:20.710
They might be helpful on your cultivation journey.

20:24.080 --> 20:25.250
What Senior Liang has given me

20:25.550 --> 20:26.750
must be something truly valuable.

20:27.070 --> 20:27.750
Thank you, Senior.

20:28.640 --> 20:29.000
Also...

20:30.640 --> 20:31.270
I know.

20:34.180 --> 20:35.220
This is the paper talisman that Mu

20:35.240 --> 20:36.480
asked me to make for her back then.

20:37.750 --> 20:38.720
This paper talisman can

20:38.750 --> 20:39.860
seal evil beings in the world.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.880
You may need it in the future.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.000
Take it,

20:43.550 --> 20:44.310
and it will fulfill

20:44.310 --> 20:45.530
Qingge's wish from back then.

20:48.300 --> 20:48.950
Thank you, Senior.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.400
I'll definitely take good care of it.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.440
Take care.

20:57.070 --> 20:57.440
Your Highness,

20:58.260 --> 20:58.970
the Puxin Village

20:59.000 --> 20:59.960
is not far ahead.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.160
The collapsed waterway

21:01.270 --> 21:02.200
is on the western side of the village.

21:02.720 --> 21:03.750
Follow this path,

21:03.970 --> 21:04.970
we can reach there in two hours.

21:06.680 --> 21:07.440
Once we're rested,

21:08.030 --> 21:08.880
we'll continue on.

21:09.270 --> 21:09.590
Yes, Your Highness.

21:10.830 --> 21:11.310
Your Highness,

21:11.680 --> 21:12.480
several supply carts ahead

21:12.510 --> 21:13.160
have their wheels stuck

21:13.350 --> 21:14.200
and have overturned into the mud.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.160
The terrain of this road

21:15.180 --> 21:16.170
seems unsuitable for carts.

21:16.560 --> 21:17.170
Mud?

21:23.740 --> 21:24.740
Take the road next to it.

21:26.070 --> 21:26.590
Let's go around.

21:26.830 --> 21:27.140
Yes, Your Highness.

21:27.160 --> 21:27.590
Yes, Your Highness.

21:41.960 --> 21:42.510
Ranran,

21:42.880 --> 21:44.110
since last night,

21:44.310 --> 21:45.240
you and Master

21:45.260 --> 21:46.260
have been giving off a strange tension.

21:46.590 --> 21:47.680
My nose is almost ruined.

21:49.000 --> 21:49.970
What happened between you two

21:50.000 --> 21:50.640
last night?

21:53.560 --> 21:54.070
Fine.

21:54.390 --> 21:55.300
Keep your secrets.

21:55.360 --> 21:56.560
So mysterious.

21:59.230 --> 21:59.790
But where exactly

21:59.790 --> 22:00.830
are we going?

22:01.110 --> 22:02.000
This place is

22:02.030 --> 22:02.680
in the middle of nowhere.

22:03.070 --> 22:03.880
Could it be that Master is taking us

22:03.880 --> 22:04.550
to fight monsters?

22:06.350 --> 22:07.830
The Reincarnation Tree branch is reacting.

22:10.590 --> 22:11.510
We should head that way.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.310
Ranran, what's wrong?

22:19.240 --> 22:19.640
Ranran.

22:20.110 --> 22:20.920
Are you feeling unwell?

22:26.640 --> 22:27.720
You've completely forgotten

22:27.820 --> 22:29.330
what you've done so quickly.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.070
What's the matter?

22:33.160 --> 22:34.270
Now you even act

22:34.270 --> 22:35.510
all cold and aloof.

22:36.030 --> 22:36.750
Shouldn't I be the one

22:36.750 --> 22:37.640
keeping distance?

22:42.550 --> 22:43.350
Master, now you get it?

22:44.960 --> 22:45.400
Xue Ranran.

22:45.720 --> 22:46.290
Stop right there.

22:47.240 --> 22:48.640
You've been in a mood since early morning.

22:48.790 --> 22:49.920
What are you up to?

22:50.610 --> 22:51.030
I...

22:53.970 --> 22:54.440
That's because...

22:54.440 --> 22:55.720
I couldn't sleep last night

22:55.830 --> 22:56.350
and felt unsettled.

22:57.310 --> 22:58.070
Unlike Master

22:58.400 --> 22:59.170
who is radiant

22:59.200 --> 23:00.110
and full of energy.

23:00.680 --> 23:01.790
Looks like the wine from last night really

23:02.160 --> 23:03.070
was quite tasty.

23:08.000 --> 23:08.550
Qiu Xi'er.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.160
Master.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.750
Why is she in such a bad mood today?

23:13.070 --> 23:14.030
Master, you're asking me?

23:14.310 --> 23:15.110
If you don't even know,

23:15.140 --> 23:15.940
how would I know?

23:24.070 --> 23:25.460
Forget it, forget it.

23:26.000 --> 23:27.350
It's something I shouldn't have dreamed of anyway.

23:27.750 --> 23:29.350
It's better to forget it all!

23:42.720 --> 23:44.270
This is the sigil of the Eastern Palace.

23:45.830 --> 23:46.750
Why did these carts

23:46.750 --> 23:47.590
break down here?

23:50.070 --> 23:51.270
The road is flat.

23:51.790 --> 23:53.160
Could there be danger nearby?

23:58.210 --> 23:59.450
There doesn't seem to be anyone around,

24:00.200 --> 24:01.680
so it shouldn't be anything unusual.

24:05.720 --> 24:07.160
Why is Su Yu here?

24:08.960 --> 24:09.790
Since everything is fine,

24:10.160 --> 24:11.240
why are you still standing here?

24:28.510 --> 24:29.720
Puxin Village.

24:30.010 --> 24:32.160
[Puxin Village]

24:30.550 --> 24:32.070
This village is so quiet.

24:32.790 --> 24:33.400
Master,

24:34.070 --> 24:35.480
are you sure we should go this way?

24:45.820 --> 24:48.820
[Puxin Village]

25:01.920 --> 25:02.440
Who's there?

25:03.680 --> 25:04.160
Get out!

25:04.790 --> 25:05.510
Don't come any closer!

25:05.800 --> 25:07.000
All of you, get out of here!

25:08.940 --> 25:09.940
Get out!

25:11.680 --> 25:13.050
Calm down.

25:15.350 --> 25:16.630
Stay back! Stay away!

25:16.650 --> 25:17.420
Be careful! Move!

25:24.000 --> 25:24.960
She must be a lunatic.

25:25.310 --> 25:26.600
She ran off pretty quick though.

25:34.410 --> 25:34.960
Let's go.

26:00.920 --> 26:02.510
We've been walking in the village for so long,

26:02.880 --> 26:03.830
finally we see someone.

26:03.490 --> 26:06.920
[Natural Residence]

26:06.000 --> 26:06.750
Esteemed guests,

26:07.240 --> 26:08.480
please, come in and have a seat.

26:08.590 --> 26:08.920
Come.

26:09.200 --> 26:09.780
Come, come, come.

26:10.270 --> 26:10.590
Quickly.

26:10.680 --> 26:11.200
Have a seat inside.

26:20.920 --> 26:21.240
Here.

26:21.400 --> 26:21.830
Guests,

26:22.110 --> 26:22.790
please have some tea.

26:25.830 --> 26:26.920
My surname is Liu.

26:27.510 --> 26:29.200
If there's anything you need,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.680
just let me know.

26:31.550 --> 26:32.270
Mr. Liu,

26:32.640 --> 26:33.480
have you recently

26:33.510 --> 26:34.350
seen a

26:34.370 --> 26:36.040
military troop passing by?

26:36.610 --> 26:37.410
Among them, there's

26:37.430 --> 26:39.040
a rather elegant and noble young master.

26:40.240 --> 26:41.270
Well...

26:41.440 --> 26:42.810
I haven't seen that.

26:44.400 --> 26:44.880
However,

26:45.400 --> 26:46.730
there are a few other households in the village.

26:46.920 --> 26:48.920
I can ask around for you.

26:49.200 --> 26:50.990
I see the forests here are dense,

26:51.120 --> 26:52.230
and the transportation is convenient.

26:52.440 --> 26:53.920
Why is this village so desolate?

26:54.030 --> 26:55.310
It seems there's hardly anyone around.

26:55.880 --> 26:57.000
Our village used to be

26:57.350 --> 26:58.480
quite populous indeed.

26:58.830 --> 26:59.830
It was very lively.

27:00.550 --> 27:01.510
But in the past decade,

27:01.720 --> 27:02.550
for some unknown reason,

27:03.110 --> 27:04.440
ground fissures have been occurring everywhere.

27:04.880 --> 27:06.070
People who passed by

27:06.440 --> 27:07.270
have disappeared one after another.

27:08.480 --> 27:08.960
Ground fissures?

27:10.550 --> 27:11.720
Something this bizarre actually happened?

27:11.920 --> 27:12.550
Yes.

27:13.110 --> 27:14.160
The even stranger thing is that

27:14.640 --> 27:15.790
shortly after the fissures appear,

27:16.070 --> 27:17.240
they would close up on their own.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.510
The villagers tried to search for the missing people

27:21.110 --> 27:21.680
by digging

27:21.710 --> 27:23.140
where the fissures had once been,

27:23.480 --> 27:24.850
but they never found any remains.

27:26.060 --> 27:26.680
Miss,

27:27.350 --> 27:28.330
could the person you're looking for

27:28.750 --> 27:29.480
encountered

27:29.920 --> 27:31.110
these fissures too?

27:33.720 --> 27:34.550
If that's the case,

27:35.110 --> 27:36.350
Young Master Yu might be in danger.

27:37.030 --> 27:38.050
How can there be such a place

27:38.290 --> 27:39.850
that swallows people without a trace?

27:45.590 --> 27:46.440
I wonder

27:47.350 --> 27:49.020
if we've angered the Mountain God.

27:50.310 --> 27:52.030
All the villagers have fled.

27:52.720 --> 27:54.090
Why haven't you left, elder?

27:56.510 --> 27:57.480
This elder here

27:58.160 --> 27:59.440
is already halfway

27:59.440 --> 28:00.720
in the grave.

28:01.240 --> 28:03.030
I might as well stay

28:03.590 --> 28:05.160
to warn passersby

28:05.270 --> 28:06.160
about the danger.

28:07.910 --> 28:08.710
Elder,

28:08.880 --> 28:09.640
don't be sad.

28:10.070 --> 28:11.550
Our Master's magical powers are incredible.

28:12.030 --> 28:13.400
He'll surely be able to identify the problem

28:13.430 --> 28:15.030
and help solve the village's...

28:17.090 --> 28:18.330
Troubles.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.350
Oh, you all are

28:22.270 --> 28:23.720
Heavenly Immortal Masters.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.200
Elder, I,

28:25.310 --> 28:26.770
failed to recognize your greatnesses.

28:27.170 --> 28:27.780
Immortal Master,

28:28.240 --> 28:28.780
I beg you

28:29.190 --> 28:30.580
to save our village.

28:31.350 --> 28:32.310
Please rise, elder.

28:34.110 --> 28:34.790
Rest assured,

28:35.480 --> 28:36.400
I will do my utmost

28:36.400 --> 28:37.200
to investigate this matter.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.200
Thank you, Immortal Master.

28:39.640 --> 28:40.510
Thank you, Immortal Master.

28:40.810 --> 28:41.590
By the way, uncle,

28:42.590 --> 28:44.310
among the few remaining households in the village,

28:44.480 --> 28:45.790
is there a mad woman?

28:46.210 --> 28:47.800
When we first entered the village,

28:48.000 --> 28:49.550
she threw slop water at us.

28:50.820 --> 28:52.880
There's no mad woman in the village.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.480
Perhaps the sky dimmed,

28:55.690 --> 28:56.880
and you mistook what you saw.

29:00.120 --> 29:01.460
It's getting late now.

29:02.280 --> 29:03.630
If you don't mind,

29:03.830 --> 29:04.940
you can stay at my place.

29:05.350 --> 29:06.380
When dawn breaks tomorrow,

29:06.550 --> 29:08.590
I'll bring you into the mountains to investigate.

29:09.590 --> 29:10.300
Thank you for your trouble then.

29:10.760 --> 29:11.610
Make yourselves at home.

29:11.720 --> 29:12.530
I'll go attend to some matters now.

29:17.350 --> 29:18.640
Ever since entering this village,

29:19.330 --> 29:20.370
I've been feeling

29:20.400 --> 29:21.350
a strange inexplicable restlessness,

29:21.760 --> 29:22.890
and it's growing stronger and stronger.

29:24.680 --> 29:25.270
Perhaps it's related to

29:25.270 --> 29:26.480
the strangeness of this village.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.720
Is it really a Spirit Spring?

29:37.110 --> 29:38.640
This village is quite strange.

29:39.350 --> 29:40.200
Young Master Yu's carriage

29:40.200 --> 29:41.640
overturned halfway for no apparent reason.

29:42.510 --> 29:43.920
The more I think about it, the more suspicious it seems.

29:44.790 --> 29:45.510
Could it be that

29:45.510 --> 29:46.790
there are harmful monsters

29:46.790 --> 29:47.820
hiding underground?

29:49.480 --> 29:50.270
It's highly likely.

29:50.840 --> 29:52.160
What should we do then?

29:52.750 --> 29:53.690
None of us have practiced

29:53.720 --> 29:54.920
the Earth-Burrowing Technique.

30:01.310 --> 30:01.790
I've got it!

30:02.270 --> 30:03.000
The Earth-Burrowing Pearl.

30:05.920 --> 30:06.640
Senior Liang's gift for us

30:06.780 --> 30:08.230
before we left is indeed reliable.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.310
This should solve the problem.

30:12.110 --> 30:13.830
Alcohol Immortal and Senior Liang,

30:14.030 --> 30:15.510
one is interesting and the other is handsome.

30:15.980 --> 30:17.890
Although Master Mu was a demon in his past life,

30:18.200 --> 30:19.000
the friends he made

30:19.110 --> 30:20.030
are quite nice.

30:20.510 --> 30:21.270
Actually, back then

30:21.270 --> 30:22.280
when I was in Xue Village,

30:22.310 --> 30:24.000
I've heard that Liang Wumeng has profound cultivation

30:24.200 --> 30:25.200
and planned on finding him.

30:25.510 --> 30:27.070
But I eventually went to Mount Wester.

30:27.350 --> 30:28.160
Otherwise, I would have...

30:28.310 --> 30:29.030
Otherwise what?

30:33.480 --> 30:34.160
Otherwise,

30:34.590 --> 30:35.680
I would have gone directly to the capital

30:35.680 --> 30:36.450
to find Liang Wumeng,

30:36.720 --> 30:37.510
cure Ling Xiao,

30:37.640 --> 30:38.830
return it to its Guardian,

30:39.440 --> 30:39.920
and then go live

30:39.920 --> 30:41.160
the life I've always longed for.

30:41.680 --> 30:42.930
I want to travel across mountains, rivers, and seas,

30:43.000 --> 30:44.270
take in all the beautiful sights of the world,

30:44.960 --> 30:45.550
and in the end,

30:46.400 --> 30:48.550
marry a handsome, ideal husband。

30:51.400 --> 30:52.340
Live a peaceful

30:52.370 --> 30:53.460
and simple life.

31:01.790 --> 31:02.400
Sure.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.240
When you get married,

31:05.070 --> 31:06.440
I'll get you a dowry.

31:07.640 --> 31:08.510
Keep your promise.

31:15.350 --> 31:16.460
Bad news! Bad news!

31:17.590 --> 31:18.160
Bad news!

31:19.160 --> 31:19.720
Bad news!

31:20.240 --> 31:20.830
Just now,

31:21.070 --> 31:22.620
I went to fetch water from the west side of the village,

31:23.350 --> 31:24.790
and it seems the ground there has cracked open again.

31:25.830 --> 31:26.510
Let's go take a look first.

31:26.790 --> 31:27.310
Yes.

31:36.460 --> 31:37.700
The soil is compacted,

31:38.030 --> 31:39.200
and it's not hollow underneath.

31:41.290 --> 31:42.490
There's a token here.

31:43.510 --> 31:44.160
Ranran.

31:47.300 --> 31:48.030
This is...

31:49.320 --> 31:50.970
The token of Young Master Yu's personal guard.

31:51.720 --> 31:52.200
Master,

31:52.640 --> 31:53.510
Young Master Yu and his group

31:53.510 --> 31:54.430
really encountered danger.

31:54.640 --> 31:56.200
We need to find a way to rescue them quickly.

31:56.950 --> 31:57.980
The crevice is so tightly closed.

31:58.750 --> 31:59.680
If it's really Su Yu,

32:00.070 --> 32:01.030
he would have been crushed to a pulp by now.

32:01.790 --> 32:02.880
There's no need to waste our energy.

32:03.880 --> 32:04.640
This place

32:05.070 --> 32:05.830
is indeed strange.

32:06.110 --> 32:06.720
We shouldn't stay long.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.030
Let's discuss it again at sunrise.

32:09.850 --> 32:10.370
Master,

32:10.830 --> 32:11.720
even if you hold grudges

32:11.720 --> 32:12.590
against Young Master Yu,

32:12.880 --> 32:14.620
a whole group have gone missing.

32:14.790 --> 32:16.110
How can we just leave like this?

32:16.440 --> 32:18.070
The Heavenly Sect doesn't interfere with affairs of the court.

32:21.100 --> 32:22.420
Young Master Yu is my friend.

32:22.890 --> 32:23.810
I won't abandon him.

32:24.560 --> 32:25.550
Ranran, don't do anything rash.

32:28.770 --> 32:30.010
You're acting for Su Yu again.

32:30.710 --> 32:32.230
You really haven't changed at all.

32:34.420 --> 32:35.000
Master.

32:44.390 --> 32:45.630
I'm at the underground now.

33:07.000 --> 33:07.790
Master.

33:07.820 --> 33:09.230
The resentment is strong here. Don't wander off.

33:11.310 --> 33:12.960
Didn't you say you wouldn't interfere?

33:14.110 --> 33:15.030
If I can't even control

33:15.030 --> 33:15.810
my own disciple,

33:15.960 --> 33:16.440
if words got out,

33:16.440 --> 33:17.400
how will Wester Sect save its face?

33:18.160 --> 33:18.880
I see.

33:19.410 --> 33:20.850
I'm just Master's disciple.

33:20.880 --> 33:21.720
How could he watch me

33:21.720 --> 33:23.160
venture into danger and not care?

33:24.240 --> 33:25.590
But in his heart,

33:25.750 --> 33:27.070
I'm just a disciple after all.

33:28.030 --> 33:28.960
Don't worry, Master.

33:29.310 --> 33:30.310
I will not get into trouble

33:30.590 --> 33:31.830
and bring shame to the Wester Sect.

33:32.550 --> 33:33.030
Master.

33:33.200 --> 33:33.750
Ranran.

33:34.480 --> 33:35.000
Master.

33:35.790 --> 33:36.770
The resentment is concentrated here.

33:36.880 --> 33:37.640
It's far from ordinary.

33:38.110 --> 33:38.960
Everyone needs to be careful.

33:39.550 --> 33:40.450
Let's go ahead and take a look.

33:55.640 --> 33:57.110
These must be the people Mr. Liu mentioned

33:57.830 --> 33:59.270
who were swallowed by the ground fissures.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.880
Their remains are all here.

34:04.310 --> 34:05.200
This space is quite deep.

34:05.340 --> 34:06.620
Ordinary people couldn't possibly reach here.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.159
No wonder those villagers

34:08.190 --> 34:09.110
couldn't find the remains.

34:10.150 --> 34:10.840
What's that?

34:14.190 --> 34:15.400
They're soldiers from the Eastern Palace.

34:15.960 --> 34:17.590
How did they end up like this?

34:20.510 --> 34:21.400
Young Master Yu!

34:26.780 --> 34:27.620
Young Master Yu.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.510
Young Master Yu.

34:29.760 --> 34:30.320
Wake up.

34:30.710 --> 34:31.710
He's still breathing.

34:33.280 --> 34:34.000
He won't die.

34:36.760 --> 34:37.480
Young Master Yu.

34:37.880 --> 34:38.590
You're awake.

34:39.670 --> 34:40.320
Ranran.

34:42.710 --> 34:43.150
Come on.

34:52.510 --> 34:53.110
Young Master Yu,

34:53.440 --> 34:54.150
are you alright?

34:54.409 --> 34:54.960
I'm fine.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.320
These are just superficial wounds.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.230
Fortunately, Ranran discovered

34:58.230 --> 34:59.440
the Crown Prince's trace,

34:59.460 --> 35:00.460
so we were able to find you.

35:03.710 --> 35:04.920
You entered such a dangerous place

35:05.230 --> 35:06.110
just to save me.

35:11.060 --> 35:12.540
Master and the others are here too, aren't they?

35:18.190 --> 35:18.890
Young Master Yu,

35:19.270 --> 35:20.430
why did you ended up here?

35:20.920 --> 35:21.920
What exactly happened?

35:23.060 --> 35:24.500
I only remember we had just entered the village

35:25.920 --> 35:27.230
and suddenly the mountain crumbled and the earth split open.

35:28.400 --> 35:29.110
Before we could react,

35:29.110 --> 35:29.840
we fell down here.

35:30.880 --> 35:31.840
Later, I was injured

35:32.110 --> 35:33.190
and was helped to walk for a while.

35:34.000 --> 35:35.550
But for some reason, I was knocked to the ground.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.000
In a semi-conscious state,

35:38.920 --> 35:39.880
I saw everyone

35:39.880 --> 35:40.920
acting as if possessed.

35:44.820 --> 35:46.040
Protect the Crown Prince!

35:59.630 --> 36:01.190
Then I completely passed out.

36:03.150 --> 36:04.710
I suppose it must have been these soldiers

36:05.190 --> 36:06.590
who protected me at the cost of their lives,

36:08.250 --> 36:09.510
so I could survive.

36:15.820 --> 36:16.880
The souls of these soldiers

36:16.880 --> 36:17.510
are all gone.

36:38.000 --> 36:38.960
How could this happen?

36:39.440 --> 36:40.480
I wanted to use the Seeing Sunflower

36:40.480 --> 36:41.480
to look at their memories,

36:41.660 --> 36:42.750
but I couldn't see anything.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.550
Their souls

36:44.960 --> 36:45.440
must have been

36:45.440 --> 36:46.440
absorbed by something.

36:48.510 --> 36:49.400
Could it be the Spirit Spring?

36:55.550 --> 36:56.230
Young Master Yu.

37:01.720 --> 37:02.550
What is that?

37:10.070 --> 37:10.880
There's a magic formation here.

37:11.090 --> 37:11.950
The Earth-Burrowing Technique can't be used.

37:11.970 --> 37:12.700
Quickly find an exit.

37:12.880 --> 37:13.280
Alright.

37:39.560 --> 37:40.360
Everyone, be careful.

37:52.710 --> 37:53.440
Master.

37:54.190 --> 37:54.960
Ranran.

37:57.440 --> 37:58.070
Ranran.

38:01.150 --> 38:01.880
Master.

38:03.230 --> 38:03.960
Ranran.

38:04.400 --> 38:05.070
Xi'er.

38:08.220 --> 38:08.970
Save me.

38:09.510 --> 38:10.110
Senior Gao!

38:10.360 --> 38:10.920
Senior Gao!

38:11.710 --> 38:12.320
Senior Gao!

38:14.120 --> 38:15.480
Senior Gao, you...

38:35.800 --> 38:36.590
Master.

38:37.510 --> 38:38.400
Xi'er.

38:40.030 --> 38:41.030
Senior Gao.

38:42.360 --> 38:42.800
Ranran.

38:44.190 --> 38:45.110
Ranran, come here.

38:45.840 --> 38:46.590
It's dangerous over there.

38:48.400 --> 38:49.400
Come to Master quickly.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.440
No.

38:52.150 --> 38:52.880
Master would never

38:52.880 --> 38:53.840
speak to me

38:53.840 --> 38:54.710
so gently.

39:00.190 --> 39:01.840
Which monster is trying to trick me?

39:02.280 --> 39:03.000
How dare you deceive me!

39:11.070 --> 39:11.920
That's so strange.

39:12.360 --> 39:13.920
This monster can even bewitch people's hearts.

39:14.630 --> 39:15.190
Ranran.

39:18.550 --> 39:19.360
Xue Ranran.

39:21.320 --> 39:21.840
You...

39:22.960 --> 39:23.960
You are real?

39:25.000 --> 39:26.480
I am your master, Su Yishui.

39:29.580 --> 39:30.290
The monsters here

39:30.320 --> 39:31.440
can mimic human voices

39:31.460 --> 39:32.090
and create illusions.

39:32.570 --> 39:33.590
Once you're drawn to them,

39:33.590 --> 39:34.480
and make eye contact with them,

39:34.880 --> 39:36.070
your soul will be absorbed.

39:36.500 --> 39:37.150
And you will

39:37.150 --> 39:38.400
turn to stone like those soldiers you saw.

39:38.970 --> 39:39.890
If you hear anything,

39:39.920 --> 39:40.590
don't believe it easily,

39:40.960 --> 39:42.150
and don't ever make eye contact with it.

39:45.190 --> 39:45.670
However,

39:45.920 --> 39:46.550
it can only steal voices

39:46.570 --> 39:47.730
from your memory and mimic them.

39:48.190 --> 39:49.440
It can't identify people's identities.

39:49.860 --> 39:51.170
Since I can tell you who I am,

39:51.390 --> 39:52.310
you can trust me now.

39:53.670 --> 39:54.840
As if I'd trust you!

39:55.360 --> 39:56.400
You might be the monster

39:56.400 --> 39:57.920
disguised as Master to trick me.

39:59.110 --> 40:00.030
The Collection of Entertainment mentioned that

40:00.630 --> 40:01.550
Master hates it most

40:01.550 --> 40:03.000
when others praise his appearance.

40:05.030 --> 40:06.320
You're so good looking.

40:08.280 --> 40:09.760
If you like, you can look all you want when we get out of here.

40:10.190 --> 40:10.880
Now, stay close to me.

40:12.880 --> 40:13.550
Don't run.

40:15.800 --> 40:17.240
If I don't, do I stay and become your snack instead?

40:17.320 --> 40:18.360
Your acting is quite convincing.

40:19.760 --> 40:20.760
The troublesome Collection of Entertainment.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.030
Didn't I tell you

40:22.030 --> 40:23.230
not to believe what's written in the Collection of Entertainment?

40:26.070 --> 40:26.840
Did you bring dried longans?

40:32.550 --> 40:33.360
Dried longans?

40:40.630 --> 40:41.800
You like eating these?

40:42.070 --> 40:42.840
I don't like to.

40:43.950 --> 40:45.540
But I like the new ones you made.

40:48.030 --> 40:48.880
Last time, when you made

40:48.880 --> 40:49.740
dried longans for me,

40:50.000 --> 40:50.630
your hands got all blistered.

40:51.330 --> 40:52.520
I told you I didn't like eating them,

40:52.550 --> 40:53.030
but eventually...

40:56.230 --> 40:57.110
I finished them all.

41:00.190 --> 41:01.150
You finished all?

41:03.400 --> 41:03.920
Also,

41:04.670 --> 41:05.480
I told you to shout "Master, help!"

41:05.510 --> 41:06.230
if you encounter danger,

41:06.410 --> 41:07.520
but you just wouldn't listen.

41:07.660 --> 41:08.460
I am very angry.

41:11.130 --> 41:11.960
What else you want to ask

41:11.960 --> 41:12.550
for me to prove myself?

41:15.150 --> 41:16.400
Then, Master, do you

41:17.300 --> 41:19.170
still remember last night?

41:19.320 --> 41:19.960
We...

41:20.710 --> 41:21.550
Xi'er.

41:23.280 --> 41:24.070
Ranran.

41:26.190 --> 41:27.150
It's Senior.

41:27.400 --> 41:28.400
Master.

41:31.040 --> 41:31.810
Xi'er.

41:38.110 --> 41:38.760
Xi'er!

41:39.940 --> 41:41.150
Do you believe me now?

41:41.740 --> 41:42.280
Alright.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.440
Then you stay here.

41:43.510 --> 41:44.400
Remember what I just said.

41:44.580 --> 41:45.460
I'll go rescue them.

42:08.920 --> 42:09.550
Yu.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.280
Yu.

42:13.220 --> 42:13.900
Qingge.

42:17.070 --> 42:17.760
Yu.

42:23.920 --> 42:24.590
Qingge.

42:45.230 --> 42:45.880
Master.

42:46.920 --> 42:47.320
Let's leave.

42:47.760 --> 42:48.110
Okay.

42:51.630 --> 42:52.360
Young Master Yu.

43:05.190 --> 43:05.840
Young Master Yu.

43:07.760 --> 43:08.400
Young Master Yu.

43:09.920 --> 43:10.400
Ranran.

43:10.760 --> 43:12.030
Fortunately, it was cut off in time.

43:12.200 --> 43:13.600
Only half of the soul was absorbed;

43:13.630 --> 43:14.340
It can still return.

43:16.630 --> 43:17.190
Thank you.
